  "task": "We manage electrical subcontractors on commercial job sites. For each worker we need to track their state electrical license: who issued it, when it expires, and whether it has been suspended. We schedule site inspections with the workers present and file an inspection report afterward. Each job has a permit number from the city. We log noise level readings at each site and record safety incidents. Before any excavation we have a duty to notify the city. Each job runs for a contract period, which the client sometimes extends.",
